title: "Thermal-field complexity descriptors for porosity prediction in laser engineered net shaping"
abstract: >-
  Experiment code for porosity prediction from melt-pool pyrometry in LENS Ti-6Al-4V thin walls,
  evaluated under layer-grouped and forward-chaining protocols on the public dataset of
  Zamiela et al. (2023).
